CuspL.description:
A linear-interpolating sound generator based on the difference equation:

teletype
	x(n+1) = a - b * sqrt(|x(n)|)

sclang code translation:

`(
var a = 1.0, b = 1.9, xi = 0, size = 64;
plot(size.collect { xi = a - (b * sqrt(abs(xi))) });
)`

