Schmidt.description:
If `in > hi`, output 1. If `in < lo`, output 0. Otherwise, repeat the
last sample of output, assumed to be 0 at initialization. In sclang-flavored
pseudocode:

`out[i] = if(in[i] < lo[i]) {
    0
} {
    if(in[i] > hi[i]) {
        1
   } {
        out[i-1]
   }
};`

